// Method Descriptions
// ========================================
agricrops_description.peripheralHelp=Method Help
agricrops_description.method.analyze=Orders the analyzer to analyze the current specimen
agricrops_description.method.getBaseBlock=Returns the necessary base block for the crop at the specified direction or the specimen in the analyzer if no direction is specified
agricrops_description.method.getBaseBlockType=Returns the base block type (NONE, BELOW, NEAR) for the crop at the specified direction or the specimen in the analyzer if no direction is specified
agricrops_description.method.getBrightness=Returns the current light level for the crop at the specified direction
agricrops_description.method.getBrightnessRange=Returns the required light level range for the crop at the specified direction or the specimen in the analyzer if no direction is specified
agricrops_description.method.getCurrentSoil=Returns the current soil below the crop at the specified direction or the specimen in the analyzer if no direction is specified
agricrops_description.method.getGrowthStage=Returns the growth percentage of the crop at the specified direction
agricrops_description.method.getNeededSoil=Returns the required soil for the crop at the specified direction or the specimen in the analyzer if no direction is specified
agricrops_description.method.getPlant=Returns the seed currently planted on the crop at the specified direction
agricrops_description.method.getSpecimen=Returns the specimen currently in the analyzer
agricrops_description.method.getStats=Returns the stats [growth, gain, strength] of crop at the specified direction or the specimen in the analyzer if no direction is specified
agricrops_description.method.hasJournal=Returns if the analyzer has a journal
agricrops_description.method.hasPlant=Returns if there is a plant on the crop sticks at the specified direction
agricrops_description.method.hasWeeds=Returns if there are weeds on the crop at the specified direction
agricrops_description.method.isAnalyzed=Returns if the crop at the specified direction, or the specimen in the analyzer (if no direction is specified) is analyzed
agricrops_description.method.isCrossCrop=Returns if the crop at the specified direction is a cross crop
agricrops_description.method.isFertile=Returns if the crop at the specified direction is fertile and can grow
agricrops_description.method.isMature=Returns if the crop crop at the specified direction is mature
agricrops_description.method.needsBaseBlock=Returns if the crop crop at the specified direction needs a base block

